---
// The takeaway callout. Bold the punchline inside it.
---
<aside class="note"><slot /></aside>
<style>
  .note { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; padding: 4px 0 4px 18px; border-left: 2px solid var(--amber-dim); margin: 0 0 24px; opacity: 0.92; }
  .note :global(p) { margin: 0 0 10px; } .note :global(p:last-child) { margin: 0; }
</style>
